 "strings": {
  "Well? Let's go.": "",
  "See, I knew you had it in you.": "",
  "See!? This is great.": "",
  "Huh. That worked out just fine.": "",
  "Well, that worked out.": "",
  "Yeah. But I'm kinda afraid of what'll happen\nif things don't go well at the club.": "",
  "Yeah. But if things don't go well over there...\nWhat's she gonna do...?": "",
  "I'm sure it'll go great.\nKnowing Saori-san, how could it not?": "",
  "It'll be fine. Knowing her,\nshe's got this!": "",
  "Genda-sensei wants to speak to you.": "",
  "Hey there, Yagami-san.\nTake a seat.": "",
  "Hey there, Yagami-san.\nYou should go sit.": "",
  "Sit down.\nI've got business with you.": "",
  "The go-to place for Saori-san's dress\nis Le Marche, over on Showa Street.": "",
  "For Saori-san's dress, you'll want to go to\nLe Marche, over on Showa Street.": "",
  "That's where all the hostesses\nin Kamurocho buy their clothes.": "",
  "They outfit most hostesses\nin Kamurocho.": "",
  "And... why do you know that, exactly?": "",
  "...Hoshino-kun, why do <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind>\nknow that, exactly?": "",
  "A good number of our clients\nhappen to be cabaret girls.": "",
  "Anyway, send me a picture of Saori-san\nonce you've picked a dress out.": "",
  "Anyway, once you've picked a dress,\nsend me a picture of Saori-san.": "",
  "I'll recommend a good stylist\nbased on what you go with.": "",
  "Based on the cut, I'll recommend\na good stylist.": "",
  "It feels like this really\noughta be you doing this...": "",
  "I really gotta say, you should be\nthe one going...": "",
  "I'm ready, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I'm ready.": "",
  "Yup, let's do it.\nWe should start with the dress.": "",
  "Got it. Okay, let's go...\nWe should start with the dress.": "",
  "Good afternoon, sir.\nWelcome to Le Marche.": "",
  "Hey, we're looking for a dress.": "",
  "We're here to get a dress\nfor her.": "",
  "Specifically one for a club called Queen Rouge.\nAny recommendations?": "",
  "Anything you'd recommend for\na club called the Queen Rouge?": "",
  "But of course, sir.": "",
  "Very well, sir.\nI'll defer the payment until then.": "",
  "Appreciated.": "",
  "Now then,\nour dresses are right this way.": "",
  "Our dresses are right this way.": "",
  "How's it going in there, Saori-san?\nAlmost done?": "",
  "So, Saori-san?\nAlmost done?": "",
  "Hold on a second.\nI don't usually dress like this.": "",
  "Hold on a second.\nI'm not really used to this.": "",
  "Y'know, it almost feels\nlike we're on a date.": "",
  "Y'know... it almost feels like\nwe're a couple on a date.": "",
  "Mafuyu won't be happy about that.": "",
  "Mafuyu's not going to like that.": "",
  "Saori-san. You've known Mafuyu\nsince you were a kid, right?": "",
  "Saori-san... You two have been friends\nsince you were a kid, right?": "",
  "Yes, we were close in our early teens. But then we\ngrew distant and didn't reconnect until law school.": "",
  "Right, I remember now.": "",
  "I remember now.": "",
  "Mafuyu's family was wealthy,\nso she knew how to socialize.": "",
  "Whereas I preferred to keep to myself.\nMy classmates often bullied me.": "",
  "Whereas all I did was keep to myself.\nMy classmates often bullied me.": "",
  "But whenever anything got too bad,\nMafuyu was always there to protect me.": "",
  "But Mafuyu was always there to protect me\nwhenever anything bad happened.": "",
  "Even then,\nshe wanted to be a prosecutor.": "",
  "Even then, she wanted to be\na prosecutor.": "",
  "She didn't know it at the time,\nbut I really respected her.": "",
  "And I, well... I really respected her.\nThough she had no idea.": "",
  "Is that why you decided\nto go into law?": "",
  "So... is that why you decided\nto go into law?": "",
  "Yes. At first,\nI wanted to be a prosecutor, too.": "",
  "Yes. At first, I wanted to\nbe a prosecutor, too.": "",
  "But ultimately, protecting the weak fits my\npersonality better than punishing evil.": "",
  "But ultimately, protecting the weak fits my personality\nbetter than punishing evil.": "",
  "Sorry, Yagami-san.\nI'm not normally this talkative.": "",
  "Sorry. I'm not normally this talkative.": "",
  "Everyone has a story to tell.": "",
  "We've all got stories.": "",
  "Speaking of which...\nMafuyu looked up to someone, too.": "",
  "Speaking of which...\nThere was someone Mafuyu looked up to, too.": "",
  "When she was just a young girl, she and her mother\nwere victims of a hit and run.": "",
  "When she was just a young girl,\nshe and her mother were victims of a hit-and-run.": "",
  "Yeah, she told me about that.": "",
  "Her mother threw herself in front of Mafuyu...\nBut ended up unstable and unconscious for a while afterward.": "",
  "Her mother shielded Mafuyu from the worst...\nbut ended up in critical condition for a while afterward.": "",
  "Yes. They ultimately caught the culprit, but Mafuyu's\nmother was still comatose at the time of the trial.": "",
  "Yes. They ultimately caught the culprit,\nbut Mafuyu's mother was still comatose at the time of the trial.": "",
  "With how young Mafuyu was at the time, it was difficult\nfor her to explain to the police what happened.": "",
  "With how young Mafuyu was at the time,\nit was difficult for her to explain to the police what happened.": "",
  "But the prosecutor was very patient, investigating\nevery last detail of how the accident happened.": "",
  "But the prosecutor never stopped investigating\nevery last detail of how it all went down.": "",
  "He fought for justice in place of a victim\nwho couldn't fight for herself.": "",
  "He fought for his client to have justice,\nbecause she couldn't fight for herself.": "",
  "In fact, that may have been\nMafuyu's first love.": "",
  "That... may have been\nMafuyu's first love.": "",
  "Huh? The prosecutor?": "",
  "She loved... the prosecutor?": "",
  "He's Mafuyu's boss now.\nMorita-san.": "",
  "And now, he's Mafuyu's boss.\nChief Prosecutor Morita.": "",
  "That's pretty crazy.\nNever expected she'd be into older men.": "",
  "Chief Prosecutor Morita... Well, never expected\nshe'd be into older men.": "",
  "Do you remember when I first introduced you two,\nYagami-san? We were all drinking together at Tender.": "",
  "Yagami-san... Do you remember when I first\nintroduced you? We were drinking together at Tender.": "",
  "That was the day Morita-san\nhad married another woman.": "",
  "That was the day Morita-san\ngot married to another woman.": "",
  "So, I wanted Mafuyu to meet someone better.\nThat's why I invited you.": "",
  "So I figured... maybe Mafuyu could meet someone better.\nThat's why I invited you.": "",
  "Now that you mention it,\nshe did seem kinda down that night.": "",
  "You know, she <font_kind=yakuza_italic>did</font_kind> seem kinda down\nthat first night.": "",
  "Does it surprise you?": "",
  "Ha... Shocked?": "",
  "Mafuyu's basically a little sister to me.\nI don't think of her like that.": "",
  "I mean, we were raised\nin a totally different—": "",
  "Sorry, I get it.\nYou don't have to keep going.": "",
  "By the way, um...\nI'm done changing.": "",
  "Um... By the way,\nI'm done changing.": "",
  "Not sure I'm gonna be\nable to sleep tonight.": "",
  "Yeah. Not sure I'm gonna be\nable to sleep tonight.": "",
  "Hehe. I'm glad I told you, then.": "",
  "Hehe. Well, I'm glad\nI told you, then.": "",
  "I'm kidding.": "",
  "I was kidding.": "",
  "Seriously, though... Meeting you helped Mafuyu\nrealize the difference between love and admiration.": "",
  "She thought your bad boy\nact was cute, by the way.": "",
  "And she thought your\nbad boy act was cute.": "",
  "Bad boy...?": "",
  "Hehe, sorry.": "",
  "Anyway, I'm done changing.": "",
  "Actually, I think I'm falling\nfor you now, Saori-san.": "",
  "Nah. I'm not chasing Mafuyu...\nI think I'm falling for you now, Saori-san.": "",
  "Where is this coming from?": "",
  "If this is a joke, Yagami-san,\nyou have terrible comedic timing.": "",
  "If this is a joke, Yagami-san...\nIt's not funny. Not funny at all.": "",
  "Come on, I'm just messing with you.": "",
  "Just messing with you.": "",
  "What an ass.": "",
  "Honestly...": "",
  "Huh, not bad.": "",
  "Heyyy, not bad.": "",
  "Hold on, lemme get a picture.": "",
  "Hold on, lemme grab a picture.": "",
  "Uploading photos without an\nindividual's permission is—": "",
  "Sorry, Hoshino-kun asked me to do it.": "",
  "No, Hoshino-kun asked me to do it.": "",
  "Said he wants to figure out\nthe best makeup for your dress.": "",
  "Ah.": "",
  "Annnd, speak of the devil.": "",
  "Whoops, speak of the devil.": "",
  "It's me, Hoshino!\nYou're a natural at this, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Hoshino here!\nYou're a genius, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Saori-san is as beautiful as ever!": "",
  "Man, this is incredible!\nI should've tagged along after all!": "",
  "So? Which salon should we go to?": "",
  "Oh, right. There's a place called Cherry,\nalso on Showa Street.": "",
  "They do top-notch work.\nIt's not far, either.": "",
  "They do some top-notch work.\nIt's not far, either.": "",
  "Got it. Thanks.": "",
  "(Hair Salon Cherry.\nThis is the place Hoshino-kun mentioned.)": "",
  "Welcome, sir.\nWhat can we do for you today?": "",
  "Whoa.\nYou look better than I expected.": "",
  "Whoaaa.\nYou look better than I expected.": "",
  "I'd rather you didn't stare like that.": "",
  "Sorry, sorry.": "",
  "Anyway, let's head to the Queen Rouge.": "",
  "...Anyway, let's head\nto the Queen Rouge.": "",
  "Yes. Come right in, sir.\nThank you for choosing us yet again.": "",
  "Hm? Oh, it's you.": "",
  "Hm?\nOh, it's you.": "",
  "Where's the girl?\nYou're gonna bring her, yeah?": "",
  "How soon can she start work?": "",
  "Tonight, long as there\naren't any problems.": "",
  "Tonight, if there are no problems.": "",
  "Girl's got potential, but we'll see whether\nor not she's got what it takes to shine.": "",
  "Girl's got potential, but we'll see if she's\nreally got what it takes...": "",
  "Holy shit.": "",
  "Whoa— Holy shit.": "",
  "This is Saori Shirosaki-san.": "",
  "You have the job!": "",
  "You're hired, you're so hired!": "",
  "You're like a freaking angel.\nCome work for us, please!": "",
  "I'm Shirosaki.\nNice to meet you.": "",
  "I think she's still kinda nervous,\nbut she'll warm up soon enough.": "",
  "No, she's perfect.\nI'm loving that I-don't-care vibe.": "",
  "I've never really entertained\nanyone before, but...": "",
  "Not a problem, not a problem at all!\nWith looks like that, who needs experience!?": "",
  "Let's get you situated.\nRight this way, beautiful.": "",
  "This is the first and last time, Yagami-san.": "",
  "This is the only time, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I know. We just have to figure out\nwhat Hashiki and Shono were talking about.": "",
  "We just have to figure out what Hashiki\nand Shono were talking about.": "",
  "The hostess they were with should know.": "",
  "The hostess they were with\nshould know.": "",
  "Okay, I'll track her down somehow.\nI'll call you once I do.": "",
  "I'll track her down somehow.\nI'll call you if I find any leads.": "",
  "Saori-san, was it?\nFollow me.": "",
  "Saori-san, was it?\nThis way. Follow me.": "",
  "Hey girl, what club you work for?": "",
  "Hey, honey, what club\nyou workin' for?": "",
  "You got a gig tonight, babe?\nWe'll pay you double!": "",
  "You wanna join us instead?\nWe'll double their offer!": "",
  "Hey, smile for me, beautiful!": "",
  "Fuck, she's hot!": "",
  "Whoa, she's a knockout...": "",
  "Whoa, she's beautiful...": "",
  "I'll knock you out.": "",
  "You think I didn't see you\nchecking that girl out!?": "",
  "O-Oh, no, I meant her dress!\nJust her dress!": "",
  "O-Oh, uh... sorry!\nI'm real sorry!": "",
  "Hey, where's she work?\nThat's where I wanna be!": "",
  "Hey, what club's that girl from?\nThat's where I wanna go!": "",
  "Now, you said you don't\nhave much experience.": "",
  "Now. You said you don't have\nmuch experience.": "",
  "But honestly, you seem okay to me.\nYour responses have been spot-on.": "",
  "Do you mean that?": "",
  "See? That humility is key! Young girls\nlike you are way too casual nowadays.": "",
  "See? That politeness is key!\nYoung girls like you are way too casual nowadays.": "",
  "I'm not even that young...": "",
  "I'm not that young...": "",
  "We're on the high end of Kamurocho clubs, you see.\nNaturally, our customers are of a higher status as well.": "",
  "Executives from massive corporations will come here to\nentertain guests, or celebrities will come to throw parties.": "",
  "Executives from massive corporations come to entertain\nguests, or celebrities will come to throw parties.": "",
  "Given their social standing, it's important\nto be as polite as possible. Understand?": "",
  "Given their social standing,\nit's important to be as polite as possible. Okay?": "",
  "Yes. Other than that, is there anything\nin particular I should be aware of?": "",
  "I understand. But...\nis there anything I should be careful of?": "",
  "Number one is, try to stay engaged, no matter what.\nAct like you're having fun, and toss out tons of compliments.": "",
  "Number one: try to stay engaged, no matter what.\nAct like you're having fun, and toss out tons of compliments.": "",
  "So I should kill them with kindness.": "",
  "I see. So, kill them with kindness.": "",
  "And once they drain their glass, get them\nto order another. Ask for one for yourself, too.": "",
  "Once they drain their glass, get them to order another.\nAsk for one for yourself, too.": "",
  "You're saying I need to beg?": "",
  "You're saying I should beg?": "",
  "Oh yeah. These guys'll do anything you want\nif you just ask nice and rub up on 'em!": "",
  "Oh yeah. Just have to ask nice and rub up on 'em,\nand these old men do whatever you want!": "",
  "I'm not doing that.": "",
  "...I'm not doing that.": "",
  "Either way, you're not gonna\nbe the only girl at the table.": "",
  "Either way, you won't be alone out there.\nI'll have other girls at your table.": "",
  "Just do it like the other hostesses do.\nThat's how everyone learns coming in.": "",
  "Just do it like the other hostesses do, and you'll be fine.\nThat's how everyone learns coming in.": "",
  "I'll see what I can do.": "",
  "...I'll try.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I'm not really here to score brownie points\nas a hostess... This is still an investigation.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I have to find the girl who was with Hashiki\nwithout blowing my cover.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(It may not be easy, but I can do this.\nIf they need this info, then I'll get it!)</color>": "",
  "Okay, it's almost time for opening! You'll be\nstarting on the floor, Saori-san. Good luck!": "",
  "Okay, it's almost time for opening!\nYou'll be starting on the floor, Saori-san!": "",
  "Hi, I'm Sumire.": "",
  "Hiya, I'm Mika!": "",
  "Hey, I'm Saori.": "",
  "Hi, I'm Saori.": "",
  "Another pretty girl to round out the trio.\nCome, come! Take a seat.": "",
  "Please call me Saori, sir.": "",
  "Oh, what a beautiful, elegant woman!\nCome, take a seat!": "",
  "Oh, such a beautiful, elegant woman!\nCome, take a seat!": ""
